        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a narrative-driven experience where nothing is as it seems.<br>A quiet town, days that repeat, and a routine that slowly begins to crack. What first feels ordinary soon turns into a disturbing chain of events that will challenge your perception of reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a game of traditional heroes or epic battles. Here, the struggle is internal, and every choice you make will bring you closer to hidden truths… or to more questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore detailed environments, talk to characters whose stories shift based on your actions, and uncover hidden fragments that reveal what lies beneath the surface.<br>Time plays a crucial role: each day introduces variations, new clues, and the consequences of your previous decisions.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a narrative-driven experience where nothing is as it seems.<br>A quiet town, days that repeat, and a routine that slowly begins to crack. What first feels ordinary soon turns into a disturbing chain of events that will challenge your perception of reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a game of traditional heroes or epic battles. Here, the struggle is internal, and every choice you make will bring you closer to hidden truths… or to more questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore detailed environments, talk to characters whose stories shift based on your actions, and uncover hidden fragments that reveal what lies beneath the surface.<br>Time plays a crucial role: each day introduces variations, new clues, and the consequences of your previous decisions.</p>",
